Subject: X acceleration

I have just committed a bit of code that enables the CopyArea acceleration
to be used within windows, and not only for moving windows.  Your
	x11perf -copywinwin500 should jump from ~17/sec to ~112/sec.
It should make scrolling a lot more pleasant.

The next acceleration in the works is solid fills.

